Hi Patrick, I think head is the way to go here.

m.ht <http://m.ht/> <- ddply(trees, .(SITEid,PLOTid,TST), function(dtfr)  head(dtfr[order(dtfr$DBH, dec = TRUE), ] , n = 8) ,.progress="text")

HTH
Luciano

